<title>PHILIPPINES: GLOBE SAYS RAISES '97 CAPEX TO 8 BLN PESO.</title>
<headline>GLOBE SAYS RAISES '97 CAPEX TO 8 BLN PESO.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Globe Telecom GMCR Inc said on Tuesday it was raising its 1997 capital expenditure to eight billion pesos from an original 4.7 billion.</p>
<p>Globe chairman Jaime Augusto Zobel de Ayala told reporters the company was going to be very aggressive in installing new land lines and cell sites for its mobile phone network.</p>
</text>
